    <string name="agent_task_budget">Task budget</string>
    <string name="agent_task_budget_prices">Cost needs model prices: turn on model details (models.dev) in Settings → Models.</string>
    <string name="agent_task_budget_body">The default limit for each task and the helpers it starts. At a limit Locus pauses between steps and asks whether to go on.</string>
    <string name="agent_task_budget_note">Cached input counts at a tenth, and time waiting for you doesn\'t count. A chat can set its own in the composer\'s options.</string>
